    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 3,
        "sourceEnd": 49,
        "text": "Hi Lin, how often do you take the bus to work?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "50bfd0a3f6d398883f415d7d311105cefd4ab00a7f18e0c8d0645bf18f175cfd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 53,
        "sourceEnd": 159,
        "text": "Well, I used to take it every day, but now I cycle more. I take the bus maybe twice a week. How about you?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "3b88816a691191a3c42dcb603fde8fdeb0dbc7f255661096fe9e2ec7c778fc43",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 163,
        "sourceEnd": 297,
        "text": "I take the subway every day. It's faster than the bus, especially in the morning. The bus is cheaper, but the subway is more reliable.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "114e294c0c40d945035496d704d7edc9595b54b66bde6c5929af2cf985b47079",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 301,
        "sourceEnd": 454,
        "text": "That's true. The subway is the fastest way to get across the city. But it's also the most crowded. Sometimes I wait for three trains before I can get on.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "9e5ff1c174acf528083e537cb0ec330e134035513b1c1d778ec08cc66d80ff85",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 458,
        "sourceEnd": 553,
        "text": "Really? I usually travel before 7 a.m., so it's not too bad. How long does your bike ride take?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "459310799b1e810867e10dd86a5a7a9ed2982580abee832a05f330a3680c65c0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 557,
        "sourceEnd": 679,
        "text": "It takes about 25 minutes. It's a bit longer than the bus, but I enjoy the exercise. And I don't have to pay for a ticket.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "2c7ba49ace35d7590530faa0a3bf5213a0c8bebad92baeb9cca8761550486220",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 683,
        "sourceEnd": 737,
        "text": "That's a good point. But what do you do when it rains?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "392d6fb3974f2f88486faee4b598f4a507f1d04577144e1fa5974dc91337b981",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 741,
        "sourceEnd": 845,
        "text": "I take the bus. The bus stop is closer to my home than the subway station. It's only a five-minute walk.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "92388a63f18a21095a7550e51e92afbd194b15dd42c00f729bf3ce4746defe8e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 849,
        "sourceEnd": 892,
        "text": "I see. So, how often do you use the subway?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "3b26e19d580b4e4b73e726fb3fea63d32bb1e938fd38adb5dc1dce7d10f5e3a6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 896,
        "sourceEnd": 1008,
        "text": "Maybe once a month, when I go to the airport. The subway goes directly there. It's the most convenient for that.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f17f4a95c45df9861644304592c24c082120bb05ef3aa769a2b91e584ac20b6d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1012,
        "sourceEnd": 1068,
        "text": "Right. And how long does the subway take to the airport?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "70708a5ac31a6122c5f72f3bc0f362730c6995e1fdcdbb6e8584b647f65cbd6c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1072,
        "sourceEnd": 1160,
        "text": "About 40 minutes. The bus takes longer, maybe an hour. But the subway is more expensive.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "a31da602d22fce6db4ba3e7d0f9d1ac1fe69b75edb198ba2f72b6cdabe5d47bd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1164,
        "sourceEnd": 1236,
        "text": "Yes, but it's worth it for the speed. Well, I have to go. See you later!",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "c3a57ea02c841e3068429cd11698ad94471558da429bdd113694d3313b1cf1e3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1240,
        "sourceEnd": 1244,
        "text": "Bye!",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c330978d116519d7b4de4d0bfba4c80063ebaf26415c437121c09753427bc6ed",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
